flowchart TD
  A[Dataset IndoDiscourse<br/>Susanto et al., 2025] --> B[Audit skema & anotasi]
  B --> C[EDA distribusi label<br/>disagreement & fitur permukaan]
  C --> D[Group-hash split 70/15/15<br/>seed split = 42]
  D --> E[Preprocessing P0 default<br/>ablasi P1/P2]
  E --> F[Training multi-seed 42/43/44]
  F --> G[Validasi: pilih threshold<br/>macro-F1]
  G --> H[Evaluasi test:<br/>F1/AP + soft MSE/CE + ECE/Brier]
  H --> I[Robustness perturbasi ringan]
  I --> J[Audit manusia<br/>preprocess / perturb / error]
  J --> K[Aggregate mean±std<br/>+ paired bootstrap CI]
  K --> L[Laporan FINAL ber-sitasi APA 7]

